<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάρον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], τό, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαίρω</span> (B)) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>broom,
				besom,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				42(1).122.48
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), Pythagorei ap.<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.727c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.207
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sweepings, refuse, rubbish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς. ἄνελε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sophr.
					160
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				15
			</span></i> (prob. cj.); of sea-weed, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				225
			</span></i>: Com., of <i>an old woman</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαιὸν οἰκίας σάρον</span> Ion Trag.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>.—The Atticists (<i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				63
			</span></i>) rejected the word, but cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. σιδαροῦν</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				6.171
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Acmonia</span>).</div>
